<title>USA: Westamerica increases quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Westamerica increases quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SAN RAFAEL, Calif. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westamerica Bancorp said Thursday it had increased its quarterly dividend to $0.26 per share from $0.23, payable February 12, record January 17.</p>
</text>
